# GitHub, not GitLab

This repo uses GitHub issues, pull requests, and GitHub Actions only.

Do not add GitLab CI, GitLab Pages, `.gitlab-ci.yml`, or `glab` workflows.

One finding → one GitHub issue → one branch → one PR against `main`. **The author does not merge their own PR.** Procedure memory: `.cursor/skills/pr-coordinator/SKILL.md` (not a hat). Cloud sweep: `.cursor/rules/pr-coordinator-cloud.mdc`. Merge gate: GitHub `APPROVE` from a non-author (`cursor[bot]` vs `artofdream` by who authored). Bugbot comments are a review signal, not the gate; autofix opens a new branch/PR.

